/sbnn
# What GoReleaser writes. Only the one at the root: web/dist is the built
# review page and is committed on purpose, so that `go install` needs no Node.
/dist/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log

# `tsc -b`'s incremental cache, rewritten by every `pnpm run build`. Unlike
# web/dist above, no .tsbuildinfo is committed on purpose anywhere, so this
# rule is not anchored: it holds their timestamps and the hashes of the
# machine that built them, which another checkout cannot use.
*.tsbuildinfo
